Hi Claudia,
 
Tree structure for privileged users changed - you now log in as 'pwg'
and wind up at the ROOT.
 
So do 'cd pub/pwg/fsg/...' (same as anonymous FTP).
 
I just tested this with 'pwg' username and it worked fine.
 
Cheers,
